[gd_scene format=3]

; The sword (M279): the slice's first weapon. A plain blade, held as the bat is (its grip, Carry).
;   Sword       CbItem     once a press; its pack sword.hold (animation_packs/sword_hold.tscn); hangs
;                          on the back while put away; each life starts with one
;     Model     the blade, its guard, grip and pommel; Sparks, started by the sheet's reactions
;     Rules     CbRules    sword.rules: the swing (left mouse button: a box where the player looks,
;                          at the clip's sword.strike marker) and the block (right button held)
; Damage, blocks and parries are the server mod's (sword.cpp).

